WEBVTT FILE

1
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:33.065
I’ve been dreaming about living
in settled communities for a while.

2
00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.756
Yes, you think about a beautiful garden,

3
00:00:41.756 --> 00:00:45.842
a dynamic house where people do things,
where it moves.

4
00:00:45.842 --> 00:00:48.358
You vaguely already
thought about that, didn’t you ?

5
00:00:56.536 --> 00:00:59.255
What we are looking for is maybe
a place that allows us…

6
00:00:59.255 --> 00:01:01.191
to permanently have
some work-in-progess

7
00:01:01.191 --> 00:01:03.584
So, not only four
walls to live our life.

8
00:01:07.264 --> 00:01:09.477
Let's build together
episode #4

9
00:01:09.477 --> 00:01:11.970
I would like to enliven this place,

10
00:01:12.001 --> 00:01:13.558
to attract people.

11
00:01:13.558 --> 00:01:17.260
I think of organizing
all kinds of formations,

12
00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:21.581
about ecology, solutions
to make our life simpler,

13
00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.720
more self-sustaining.

14
00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:26.358
The wind turbine workshop,
it’s only the beginning,

15
00:01:26.358 --> 00:01:27.808
like a pilot project, a test.

16
00:01:43.081 --> 00:01:47.496
We have three workshops.
Metal, with welding, angle grinder.

17
00:01:47.496 --> 00:01:51.056
We also have a blade,
woodenworks and mould conception.

18
00:01:51.056 --> 00:01:53.666
And finally, the
electric part, winding.

19
00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:08.150
It’s all about participation,
very open-minded, there is no rule.

20
00:02:13.261 --> 00:02:17.511
The idea is for everyone to see
and participate to everything

21
00:02:17.511 --> 00:02:20.811
and to learn from all
these different activities.

22
00:02:25.419 --> 00:02:29.900
It’s not gonna be easy to get a
sharped edge all along

23
00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:34.674
and a curved part on
this side of the blade.

24
00:02:34.674 --> 00:02:37.608
So let’s make it step by step

25
00:02:37.608 --> 00:02:39.872
but it will definitely be tricky.

26
00:02:40.721 --> 00:02:42.270
Yeah, it’s alright,
it’s a small marge.

27
00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.657
As this angle is acute,

28
00:02:44.657 --> 00:02:47.941
it allows you to have a clean junction.

29
00:02:48.971 --> 00:02:51.440
After, we winded in stars.

30
00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.448
So this part is neutral.

31
00:02:53.448 --> 00:02:56.062
This is the neutral
wiring the first three coils…

32
00:02:56.452 --> 00:02:59.205
What’s nice is that we have a good group.
We have some ten trainees

33
00:02:59.205 --> 00:03:01.948
and some more people who came to help.

34
00:03:11.058 --> 00:03:16.061
Each person has skills and
knowledges that we share altogether.

35
00:03:16.061 --> 00:03:21.667
And that’s really, really nice !
Cause we learn so much.

36
00:03:26.978 --> 00:03:30.639
I personally made things this week
I absolutely didn’t know how to do before.

37
00:03:30.639 --> 00:03:34.181
And by the end of the week, I now have
the impression I know how to do it.

38
00:03:36.407 --> 00:03:39.586
The machine we are making this week
is 2m40 as a diameter.

39
00:03:39.586 --> 00:03:41.844
It is a smaller machine.

40
00:03:41.844 --> 00:03:45.954
For a personal windmill that will be
connected to the system

41
00:03:45.954 --> 00:03:49.464
for all our classic needs,
usually, we make a 3m60 or 4m20 long one.

42
00:03:58.161 --> 00:04:02.004
What a week, really,
I learnt so much

43
00:04:02.004 --> 00:04:05.915
and I won’t keep them for myself.
I will transmit them.

44
00:04:16.478 --> 00:04:17.732
Working this way, indeed…

45
00:04:17.732 --> 00:04:20.291
there are trainings on many
different topics as well,

46
00:04:20.291 --> 00:04:22.927
DIY, eco-building,

47
00:04:22.927 --> 00:04:25.539
solar ovens and many other topics.

48
00:04:25.545 --> 00:04:29.501
And I find this awesome for people
to learn to do this by themselves,

49
00:04:29.501 --> 00:04:32.327
to build their house
or their energy system,

50
00:04:32.327 --> 00:04:35.725
it should be developed more and more

51
00:04:35.725 --> 00:04:38.936
so we can go a bit out
of the system we’re in.

52
00:05:14.416 --> 00:05:18.967
Thanks to Looping for the music
and to Nicolas Casaux for the translation of the video in english.

53
00:05:23.707 --> 00:05:28.385
Collective and independant work
You can participate by contributing to the crowdfunding or by sharing your skills (translations, corrections)
www.side-ways.net/en/participez
Thanks to everybody !

54
00:05:28.385 --> 00:05:32.345
Discover the multimedia article in english
